.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-build-whatdependson 1  "geectl-build-whatdependson 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-build\-whatdependson \- List the packages that depend on a package for their build
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl build whatdependson\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> <\fIREPOSITORY\fR> <\fIARCH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the packages that depend on a package for their build
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the repository is in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to find the dependents of
.TP
<\fIREPOSITORY\fR>
The repository to read
.TP
<\fIARCH\fR>
The architecture to read
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
